WEBVTT

00:14.139 --> 00:15.348
[dramatic music playing]

00:18.601 --> 00:20.270
[cop] Damn it. Seriously?

00:20.353 --> 00:21.521
CHOI TAE-HO

00:23.690 --> 00:24.524
[sighs]

00:34.284 --> 00:38.163
MR. OH, HWANG YANG-JUNG
LEE DU-YEONG, HYEON-JU

00:46.713 --> 00:49.632
- Aren't you going home?
- I was just house-hunting, sir.

00:51.092 --> 00:53.678
Man, it's not easy
buying a house nowadays.

00:54.387 --> 00:55.221
Taking a honeymoon?

00:56.389 --> 01:00.060
My wife wants us to go to Paris,
but I don't think we'll go with COVID.

01:00.143 --> 01:01.936
Ugh, goddamn COVID.

01:03.021 --> 01:03.897
[sighs]

01:06.149 --> 01:07.859
How come you're here so late, sir?

01:12.030 --> 01:14.783
So, something big came in.

01:15.825 --> 01:19.162
I've been keeping tabs on a loan shark
for about half a year now,

01:19.245 --> 01:21.623
and this fucking asshole
takes videos of people,

01:21.706 --> 01:23.541
so he has something to threaten them with.

01:24.375 --> 01:27.754
And today I happened to receive
a list of all the asshole's victims.

01:28.296 --> 01:29.380
I'll share it with you.

01:29.464 --> 01:32.050
I'll organize the data,
and we can dive into it together.

01:33.885 --> 01:35.261
- Sounds good, sir.
- [chuckles]

01:36.679 --> 01:37.931
- Get back to searching.
- Will do.

01:38.014 --> 01:38.848
[chuckles]

01:41.017 --> 01:42.393
[suspenseful music playing]

01:43.144 --> 01:43.978
[Myeong-gil] Mm.

01:44.062 --> 01:45.647
[cop] He said he got the list today.

01:46.940 --> 01:48.608
He probably didn't do it alone.

01:49.317 --> 01:52.612
Find me the asshole who helped him,
and I'll pay you 100 million per person.

01:53.780 --> 01:54.948
Yes, sir.

01:55.532 --> 01:57.659
When will you get Oh In-muk's location?

01:57.742 --> 02:00.161
I think I can find
his credit card locations

02:00.245 --> 02:04.541
of the last seven days…
probably by tomorrow morning.

02:06.126 --> 02:08.503
I'll pay you as soon as I receive it.
Good luck.

02:08.586 --> 02:09.420
[line disconnects]

02:14.134 --> 02:15.343
[whispering] A hundred million.

02:15.885 --> 02:16.719
[chuckles]

02:17.595 --> 02:18.638
What's up?,

02:18.721 --> 02:19.722
[inhales sharply]

02:20.390 --> 02:23.476
The only person who knew
where hard drive was, was Jang-do.

02:23.560 --> 02:26.646
The asshole must have snitched
when President Choi nabbed him.

02:26.729 --> 02:27.689
[inhales sharply]

02:27.772 --> 02:32.861
The fuckers who were with him
teamed up with Hong. Fucking shithead.

02:33.444 --> 02:34.320
Oppa.

02:35.280 --> 02:38.783
- You said there's only one hard drive?
- [scoffs]

02:40.410 --> 02:42.203
There's only one hard drive.

02:44.038 --> 02:47.208
But everything's backed up on a laptop

02:47.292 --> 02:50.128
that we use to transfer the videos
to the drive.

02:50.211 --> 02:51.421
[laughing]

02:52.505 --> 02:53.590
Oh!

02:55.175 --> 02:57.218
For now, we should just stay put.

02:58.720 --> 03:00.847
If we release that video
at the wrong time,

03:01.347 --> 03:06.394
then that son of a bitch, Hong,
is going to hit us with a tax audit.

03:06.477 --> 03:07.812
Stupid motherfucker.

03:10.899 --> 03:11.733
Oppa,

03:12.775 --> 03:16.237
wouldn't it be better to let them know
you still have the video?

03:19.115 --> 03:20.491
You need to scare them.

03:21.492 --> 03:22.410
[chuckles softly]

03:22.994 --> 03:26.206
[both laughing]

03:26.289 --> 03:28.499
- You're a smart cookie, aren't you?
- [laughs]

03:29.334 --> 03:30.543
A toast!

03:31.044 --> 03:32.253
- And cheers!
- Cheers!

03:36.758 --> 03:39.052
ADDRESS, MART
GAS STATION, RICE STORE

03:39.135 --> 03:41.137
[suspenseful music playing]

03:55.902 --> 03:58.696
GOHEUNG GROCERIES

03:59.405 --> 04:00.782
Have you seen this person before?

04:00.865 --> 04:02.283
[employee] Uh, I'm not sure.

04:02.367 --> 04:05.286
Our customers walk around in masks,
so it's hard to tell.

04:06.246 --> 04:07.664
[goon] Oh, yeah? Is that so?

04:08.164 --> 04:09.374
Ah, fuck me.

04:10.625 --> 04:11.793
Right, take another look.

04:15.546 --> 04:16.798
Oh. [laughs]

04:17.298 --> 04:18.341
I really don't know.

04:18.424 --> 04:19.676
You think this is funny?

04:20.218 --> 04:22.720
- Excuse me?
- Do you think this is fucking funny?

04:22.804 --> 04:24.222
Uh, no, that's not what I--

04:25.640 --> 04:26.849
Goddammit.

04:27.684 --> 04:28.768
Eyes down, shithead.

04:29.519 --> 04:31.562
- [employee breathing rapidly]
- [goon] Look. Do you know him?

04:31.646 --> 04:32.689
[employee] I… I don't know.

04:32.772 --> 04:36.025
[goon] Yes or no, you little fuck!
Get up, get up, get up!

04:36.109 --> 04:37.527
- Do you know him or not?
- I don't know him.

04:37.610 --> 04:40.280
Do you know him or not, you piece of shit?
I said look at him. Look.

04:40.822 --> 04:42.198
Speak up, you fucking shit.

04:42.865 --> 04:44.158
Ah, fuck this.

04:44.659 --> 04:45.493
[goon] Look at the picture.

04:45.576 --> 04:47.829
- Hello, sir.
- Oh, hello. Welcome.

04:47.912 --> 04:49.580
- I'd like to ask you something.
- Okay, okay.

04:49.664 --> 04:53.251
I'm looking for someone.
He's a friend of my dad's.

04:54.877 --> 04:56.504
Oh, yes, I know him.

04:56.587 --> 04:58.589
- You know this man?
- I do, but what's this about?

04:58.673 --> 04:59.882
Well, I'm getting married,

04:59.966 --> 05:01.926
and I'd like to send him
a wedding invitation.

05:02.010 --> 05:03.011
Oh.

05:03.094 --> 05:04.220
Do you know where he lives?

05:04.304 --> 05:07.640
Of course. After all,
I deliver rice there every month.

05:08.391 --> 05:10.685
Could I get an address from you?

05:11.185 --> 05:12.395
Oh, sure. I'll get it for you.

05:14.355 --> 05:16.357
[tense music playing]

05:23.448 --> 05:24.782
[theme music playing]

05:51.601 --> 05:54.812
BLOODHOUNDS

06:00.985 --> 06:01.819
[Woo-jin] He's here.

06:05.907 --> 06:07.450
Kang In-beom's profile.

06:08.076 --> 06:10.620
His info right, right, right here, guys.

06:11.371 --> 06:12.246
[Woo-jin] Ah.

06:12.330 --> 06:13.706
You work fast.

06:14.207 --> 06:16.376
Every second counts
in situations like this.

06:16.459 --> 06:18.378
- Thank you very much.
- All right. [chuckles]

06:19.337 --> 06:20.171
- It's done.
- Yeah.

06:20.254 --> 06:21.339
[chuckles]

06:22.382 --> 06:24.342
[sighs, chuckles]

06:24.425 --> 06:26.302
[all chuckle]

06:27.387 --> 06:28.721
[laughing]

06:28.805 --> 06:30.390
[both laughing]

06:31.307 --> 06:32.308
[laughing louder]

06:32.892 --> 06:34.894
[both laughing louder]

06:35.728 --> 06:37.271
[fading laughter]

06:37.355 --> 06:39.148
This is it?

06:39.232 --> 06:40.108
Huh?

06:41.150 --> 06:43.027
Ah, so you don't know?

06:43.945 --> 06:47.532
Normally, when you make
someone do something like this,

06:48.491 --> 06:52.370
- You give a little token of thanks.
- Oh, right. How much should we give you?

06:53.413 --> 06:54.705
You know, a one piece.

06:54.789 --> 07:00.586
I mean, we're… we're a team and family.
A big one will do. Yeah! [chuckles]

07:00.670 --> 07:01.838
- Okay, all right.
- Yeah.

07:01.921 --> 07:03.214
- Thank you.
- [chuckles]

07:04.715 --> 07:06.300
Hey, call me whenever you need something.

07:06.384 --> 07:08.344
- Will do. Have a nice day.
- Good night, then.

07:08.428 --> 07:09.262
Mm.

07:20.398 --> 07:22.066
Fuck, man. I meant a million won.

07:25.278 --> 07:27.488
PERSONAL INFORMATION
KANG IN-BEOM

07:27.572 --> 07:28.698
[lock chimes]

07:30.867 --> 07:32.160
[Woo-jin exhales]

07:34.537 --> 07:36.706
- She told us not to use it though.
- [exhales deeply]

07:37.415 --> 07:40.168
We have to look at it on a big screen
to get a better look at his neighborhood.

07:40.251 --> 07:42.420
Right. What if Da-min comes in
while we're at it.

07:43.296 --> 07:46.215
She won't. We got caught before
because she was passing by.

07:46.299 --> 07:47.550
It was bad luck.

07:49.719 --> 07:52.597
- [Gun-woo] "Gangdong-gu, Seonggu-ro."
- "Seonggu-ro."

07:52.680 --> 07:53.514
[elevator dings]

07:54.515 --> 07:56.100
- [panting]
- [rock music playing]

07:56.184 --> 07:57.810
[keypad beeping]

07:57.894 --> 08:00.146
[groans] I told you she'd come.
Turn it off.

08:00.229 --> 08:01.189
Oh, God.

08:01.272 --> 08:02.440
[music ends]

08:03.858 --> 08:05.735
[sniffing]

08:06.944 --> 08:08.237
Uh, what are you doing?

08:09.363 --> 08:11.824
[sighs] It smells like lonely men in here.

08:12.700 --> 08:14.285
Why are you using the computer again?

08:14.368 --> 08:15.745
I told you not to.

08:16.537 --> 08:17.455
We're sorry.

08:17.538 --> 08:19.582
Also, sorry about the lonely man smell.

08:19.665 --> 08:20.917
Damn.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.336
Whatever. This room is ruined.

08:23.419 --> 08:24.253
It's ruined.

08:24.337 --> 08:25.213
Da-min!

08:26.672 --> 08:28.966
- What is it?
- I'm also sorry about today.

08:29.050 --> 08:30.635
I'll take care of this putrid smell.

08:31.260 --> 08:32.345
How will you?

08:32.428 --> 08:33.346
A diffuser.

08:33.846 --> 08:37.642
A diffuser will get rid of
this sad old-man smell.

08:37.725 --> 08:38.559
[Da-min] Really?

08:38.643 --> 08:40.728
First of all, to get rid of a bad smell,

08:40.811 --> 08:42.522
you just have to find
an opposing good scent.

08:42.605 --> 08:45.691
This sad old-man smell is
basically a blend of a thick, musky odor

08:45.775 --> 08:47.777
with slight, unintentional undertones
of rotten wood.

08:47.860 --> 08:49.779
To get rid of it,
we need the opposing scent.

08:50.947 --> 08:53.908
Something floral and fruity.

08:53.991 --> 08:55.910
I use Baies, Baies from Diptyque.

08:55.993 --> 08:57.828
- I like that one.
- [Woo-jin] Well, all right.

08:58.538 --> 08:59.539
Then we're in luck!

08:59.622 --> 09:02.208
The fresh sweetness in the Baies
will cancel out

09:02.291 --> 09:05.419
all the sad old-man smell here.

09:06.587 --> 09:08.548
We'll get you one
when we leave this place.

09:09.173 --> 09:10.591
- A gift.
- Yeah.

09:10.675 --> 09:12.635
We'll get you one for the ground floor,
one for the top bunk.

09:12.718 --> 09:13.761
Bathroom too.

09:13.844 --> 09:15.304
Okay, three it is.

09:15.388 --> 09:16.264
Deal.

09:16.347 --> 09:18.182
[cell phone vibrating]

09:26.440 --> 09:28.776
Dude, how does Kang In-beom
know my number? He's calling now.

09:29.986 --> 09:31.112
[Woo-jin] Whoa, no way.

09:31.195 --> 09:32.738
Something must be wrong here, right?

09:34.198 --> 09:36.033
[uptempo instrumental music playing]

09:37.660 --> 09:38.828
[both exhale sharply]

09:41.163 --> 09:42.164
[Gun-woo] Oh god.

09:43.291 --> 09:45.001
[Da-min] What's wrong with Grandpa?

09:46.043 --> 09:47.211
Who did this to him?

09:47.712 --> 09:48.546
Uh…

09:52.258 --> 09:53.134
No!

09:53.634 --> 09:56.345
[In-beom] Come to Incheon's
Four Garden shopping mall in one hour.

09:57.054 --> 10:00.182
Call the cops, and the old man dies.

10:00.266 --> 10:01.475
You're fucking dead.

10:03.269 --> 10:04.186
[Gun-woo] Uh…

10:04.270 --> 10:06.272
Uh, Da-min, you should tell us
what he said too.

10:06.939 --> 10:08.816
He said to come to Four Garden mall
in an hour.

10:08.899 --> 10:10.651
He said if we call the cops,

10:12.236 --> 10:13.237
he'll kill Grandpa.

10:14.614 --> 10:15.448
[sighs]

10:15.990 --> 10:17.908
[smacks lips] Come on.
There's not much time.

10:20.911 --> 10:22.622
[uptempo instrumental music playing]

10:27.001 --> 10:28.169
[both breathing deeply]

10:33.174 --> 10:34.425
[Woo-jin] Gun-woo.

10:34.508 --> 10:37.178
- How many do you think will be there?
- Uh, at least 30.

10:37.261 --> 10:38.429
They'll probably have weapons.

10:38.512 --> 10:41.265
and, uh, Kang In-beom and Mr. Jung
will probably be there.

10:42.058 --> 10:44.185
Do you think it would be a good idea
to call Gang-yong?

10:44.852 --> 10:48.773
[grunts] No, that would put Mr. Oh
in too much danger.

10:48.856 --> 10:52.318
- [exhales sharply] What about our senior?
- Which senior?

10:52.401 --> 10:53.235
You know, Mr. Moon.

10:54.528 --> 10:55.571
But he hurt his arm, right?

10:55.655 --> 10:57.615
Wouldn't he help in any way that he could?

10:57.698 --> 10:59.450
Uh, that's true, but…

11:00.951 --> 11:01.952
You two ready?

11:02.036 --> 11:05.373
Yes, but Da-min, what's the bow for?

11:06.082 --> 11:07.041
For rescuing Grandpa.

11:07.124 --> 11:09.752
Uh, no. There's no way.
We'll go just the two of us.

11:09.835 --> 11:11.212
It's too dangerous for you.

11:13.297 --> 11:14.382
Move over.

11:14.465 --> 11:16.884
[Woo-jin hesitating]
Da-min, why would you--

11:16.967 --> 11:18.177
Whoa!

11:26.477 --> 11:27.770
I also know how to fight.

11:28.896 --> 11:30.648
I'm coming, so don't try to stop me.

11:32.233 --> 11:34.193
What are you doing? We don't have time.

11:34.819 --> 11:36.821
Hey, she's a good shot.

11:36.904 --> 11:37.738
Hey,

11:38.531 --> 11:39.865
I think she'll be useful.

11:43.953 --> 11:45.496
Hello, sir, it's Woo-jin.

11:45.579 --> 11:46.706
[dramatic music playing]

11:46.789 --> 11:47.623
Mr. Oh…

11:48.374 --> 11:49.333
[exhales deeply]

11:49.417 --> 11:50.459
…has been kidnapped.

11:52.253 --> 11:54.255
Can you, uh, help us in any way?

11:54.338 --> 11:56.465
I'm also indebted to Mr. Oh.

11:57.466 --> 11:59.510
Don't go in without me, no matter what.

12:00.261 --> 12:01.220
That's an order.

12:06.726 --> 12:07.560
[grunting]

12:11.731 --> 12:12.606
[grunts]

12:16.861 --> 12:20.322
- [tires screeching]
- [engine revving]

12:27.455 --> 12:29.457
[engine revs]

12:46.891 --> 12:47.725
[music ends]

12:48.309 --> 12:51.312
MOON GWANG-MU
734TH CLASS SENIOR

12:56.650 --> 12:57.735
[line ringing]

12:59.028 --> 13:00.237
[Woo-jin grunts]

13:04.450 --> 13:06.202
My Junior Marines, you're finally here.

13:06.285 --> 13:08.788
- Yes, sir.
- Wow, sir, you've really gone all out.

13:08.871 --> 13:11.290
Oh, yeah, I had this lying around.

13:11.832 --> 13:14.168
It really itches. I think it's pretty old.

13:14.251 --> 13:15.920
Should probably take it off soon.

13:28.390 --> 13:30.643
Through the underground parking lot,
I'll--

13:30.726 --> 13:31.644
Wait, who are you?

13:32.228 --> 13:33.646
I'm here to rescue my grandpa.

13:35.314 --> 13:36.774
She's Mr. Oh's granddaughter.

13:37.608 --> 13:39.276
Oh. Oh, right.

13:39.360 --> 13:41.070
Your faces are similar. I can see it.

13:41.153 --> 13:42.780
- [Mr. Moon laughs]
- It's almost been an hour.

13:43.364 --> 13:44.406
Right, right.

13:44.490 --> 13:45.699
And what's in the bag?

13:45.783 --> 13:47.076
It's a compound bow.

13:47.952 --> 13:48.786
A guobaorou?

13:49.411 --> 13:50.704
Compound bow.

13:50.788 --> 13:51.664
Guo--

13:51.747 --> 13:53.958
Sir, it's a competition bow.

13:54.041 --> 13:55.459
Uh-huh.

13:55.543 --> 13:58.003
Oh, right.
Koreans are really good at archery, yeah.

13:58.087 --> 13:59.088
[chuckles]

13:59.630 --> 14:00.631
Is she a good shot?

14:00.714 --> 14:01.841
She is.

14:03.259 --> 14:06.220
All right, so Archer and I will take
the stairs from the parking lot

14:06.303 --> 14:08.013
and make our way
to the top of the building.

14:08.097 --> 14:11.058
Our two Marines,
you charge in through the front gates.

14:11.141 --> 14:13.435
We'll cover fire from the top. Understood?

14:13.519 --> 14:14.812
- Yes, sir.
- [Mr. Moon] Let's move.

14:15.896 --> 14:16.856
Go.

14:16.939 --> 14:17.940
- Follow me.
- [Da-min] Okay.

14:18.023 --> 14:19.775
[tense music playing]

14:22.361 --> 14:23.445
[both panting]

14:23.988 --> 14:25.489
- [Mr. Moon] This way.
- Right, okay.

14:34.915 --> 14:36.458
[ominous music playing]

14:57.730 --> 14:58.564
[music ends]

14:58.647 --> 14:59.857
Where is Mr. Oh?

15:01.275 --> 15:02.776
Kill them!

15:05.070 --> 15:06.280
[goon 1 groans]

15:06.363 --> 15:07.239
[Gun-woo grunts]

15:16.332 --> 15:18.834
One, two, three!

15:21.670 --> 15:22.963
[Gun-woo exhales sharply]

15:25.007 --> 15:26.842
- [Gun-woo grunting]
- [goons groaning]

15:26.926 --> 15:28.677
[uptempo electronic music playing]

15:29.637 --> 15:30.846
[screams]

15:33.223 --> 15:34.391
[shouts]

15:39.813 --> 15:40.898
[goon 2 screams]

15:45.903 --> 15:47.655
[groaning]

15:48.906 --> 15:50.407
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- [goon 3 groans]

15:51.700 --> 15:52.701
Wow.

15:52.785 --> 15:53.911
- Good job.
- [goon 4] Get them.

15:53.994 --> 15:55.496
[goon 5] Where? Who is it?

15:56.497 --> 15:58.040
[screaming]

15:58.123 --> 16:00.918
[goon 6] What is it?
Where is it coming from?

16:01.543 --> 16:02.670
[screams]

16:02.753 --> 16:04.254
[goon 7] Hey, hey!

16:04.338 --> 16:05.506
[goon 8] Up there!

16:05.589 --> 16:07.091
Get the black one. The black one.

16:07.174 --> 16:08.509
[goon 9] Who is it? Who's doing this?

16:09.969 --> 16:11.136
[Woo-jin grunts]

16:17.559 --> 16:19.269
The blue one there. There, the guy there.

16:22.648 --> 16:23.857
[panting]

16:23.941 --> 16:24.775
Damn it.

16:24.858 --> 16:26.860
You keep helping out the juniors, okay?

16:27.361 --> 16:28.862
Oh, fuck. Fuck!

16:31.281 --> 16:32.449
[grunts]

16:35.536 --> 16:36.453
Hey there, blue boy.

16:37.997 --> 16:39.498
Are you on the track team or something?

16:40.082 --> 16:41.250
Fucking shit!

16:43.043 --> 16:45.045
- [Mr. Jung groaning]
- [grunting]

16:52.344 --> 16:53.220
[shouts]

16:58.892 --> 16:59.727
[goon 10 groans]

17:04.356 --> 17:05.232
[Woo-jin] Get lost!

17:05.315 --> 17:06.525
[Gun-woo grunting]

17:12.156 --> 17:13.490
[goons groaning]

17:19.830 --> 17:21.206
[In-beom grunting]

17:23.917 --> 17:25.711
[Woo-jin grunting]

17:25.794 --> 17:27.337
[panting]

17:33.552 --> 17:35.554
What are you doing? Get up.

17:35.637 --> 17:37.139
[breathing heavily]

17:39.683 --> 17:41.351
[both grunting]

17:43.979 --> 17:45.272
[groaning]

17:48.525 --> 17:49.902
[grunts, shouts]

17:55.616 --> 17:56.825
[both grunting]

17:57.618 --> 17:58.452
[grunts]

17:59.036 --> 18:00.871
[both grunting]

18:05.125 --> 18:06.168
[Mr. Moon choking]

18:08.629 --> 18:10.714
[Mr. Moon grunting]

18:16.845 --> 18:17.971
[exhales sharply]

18:22.267 --> 18:23.310
Shit.

18:25.646 --> 18:26.980
[rock music playing]

18:27.064 --> 18:29.650
[Mr. Moon grunting]

18:29.733 --> 18:30.651
[Mr. Jung grunts]

18:33.737 --> 18:35.280
[both grunting]

18:39.660 --> 18:40.869
[grunting]

18:42.538 --> 18:44.540
[Mr. Moon screams]

18:46.917 --> 18:49.294
- [Mr. Jung grunting]
- [screaming]

18:51.588 --> 18:52.464
[Mr. Jung groans]

18:52.548 --> 18:54.258
[uptempo electronic music playing]

18:56.385 --> 18:57.719
[Woo-jin grunting]

18:59.763 --> 19:01.098
[Mr. Jung screams]

19:04.685 --> 19:05.519
- Shit!
- [grunts]

19:08.981 --> 19:10.065
[panting]

19:12.151 --> 19:13.694
[shallow breathing]

19:13.777 --> 19:15.737
[heavy breathing]

19:20.242 --> 19:22.536
Guess you need a knife to beat me,
huh, tough guy?

19:22.619 --> 19:24.913
- [scoffs]
- Then pull it out, asshole.

19:26.081 --> 19:26.957
Come on.

19:28.417 --> 19:29.293
[inhales sharply]

19:32.254 --> 19:33.839
You've got pride, after all.

19:35.716 --> 19:36.550
Let's go.

19:38.677 --> 19:40.012
[electronic music playing]

19:41.805 --> 19:42.681
[Gun-woo grunts]

19:46.643 --> 19:47.936
[Gun-woo grunts]

19:48.020 --> 19:50.439
[In-beom grunting]

19:53.901 --> 19:54.985
[In-beom grunts]

19:55.736 --> 19:56.778
[Gun-woo grunts]

19:58.238 --> 19:59.364
[Gun-woo grunts]

19:59.448 --> 20:00.908
[Gun-woo shouts]

20:02.659 --> 20:03.577
[both groaning]

20:08.373 --> 20:10.375
[both grunting]

20:15.380 --> 20:17.341
[groaning]

20:18.550 --> 20:19.927
Oh, hey, are you… [grunts]

20:20.010 --> 20:20.844
…are you all right?

20:20.928 --> 20:22.012
Not really.

20:25.432 --> 20:26.850
[exhaling rapidly]

20:26.934 --> 20:28.560
[inhales deeply]

20:31.521 --> 20:33.857
[shouting]

20:35.025 --> 20:37.778
- [shouting]
- [groaning]

20:39.363 --> 20:40.530
[shouting]

20:41.531 --> 20:42.866
[grunting]

20:48.038 --> 20:49.873
[panting]

20:57.130 --> 20:58.465
- [Woo-jin grunts]
- [groans]

21:00.926 --> 21:03.804
One, two, three, four!

21:03.887 --> 21:06.640
One, two, three, four!

21:07.849 --> 21:09.476
- [Gun-woo grunting]
- [In-beom groaning]

21:14.022 --> 21:15.148
- [Gun-woo shouts]
- [groans]

21:17.192 --> 21:18.026
[music ends]

21:18.610 --> 21:20.612
[breathing deeply]

21:29.579 --> 21:31.206
[Mr. Moon] All right. Track guy.

21:31.790 --> 21:34.334
Hey! Hey, hey, hey, asshole. Wake up!

21:34.418 --> 21:36.086
Come on. Up, up, up!

21:36.169 --> 21:37.212
Up!

21:37.296 --> 21:38.630
So where's Mr. Oh?

21:38.714 --> 21:39.631
[scoffs]

21:40.215 --> 21:41.466
Look at this asshole.

21:41.550 --> 21:43.468
Does he think he's being a tough guy
or something?

21:43.552 --> 21:45.721
- Hey, Archer, give me an arrow quick!
- [Da-min] Huh?

21:46.305 --> 21:48.056
I'll give it back.
I just need it for a second.

21:48.140 --> 21:52.185
[chuckles] All right, let's see
what a loyal bloodhound this guy is.

21:52.686 --> 21:54.146
I was like you, you know?

21:54.229 --> 21:56.315
Well, back when Mr. Choi was alive.

21:56.940 --> 22:01.945
But do you know what becomes
of a bloodhound that's lost its master?!

22:02.487 --> 22:05.824
It becomes a filthy stray
that mauls everyone in sight.

22:05.907 --> 22:06.950
Oh!

22:07.034 --> 22:08.160
[groaning]

22:10.120 --> 22:11.038
[Mr. Jung groans]

22:11.872 --> 22:13.749
Oh, no. No!

22:14.583 --> 22:16.752
This isn't pain that you're feeling.
It's just shock.

22:16.835 --> 22:18.462
The real pain comes

22:19.796 --> 22:22.215
- when I pull this bad boy out!
- [screams]

22:25.344 --> 22:29.306
Hey guys, could you…
please cover Archer's ears for a second?

22:34.770 --> 22:36.021
You married, shithead?

22:37.189 --> 22:42.652
Because the important thing
in the whole world is family.

22:42.736 --> 22:46.490
But without this, buddy,
you'll never be able to make one.

22:47.991 --> 22:50.118
So, work or family?

22:50.202 --> 22:52.120
You better choose wisely.

22:52.996 --> 22:56.166
- [inhales sharply]
- I gotta admit, you choose work right now,

22:56.249 --> 22:57.959
that's gonna make you a real pro.

22:58.043 --> 23:01.463
But obviously, in that case,
I'm gonna have to puncture your balls.

23:02.130 --> 23:05.050
"Why?" you ask. Because I'm also a pro.

23:06.093 --> 23:07.135
All right.

23:08.470 --> 23:10.013
You got three.

23:10.097 --> 23:11.223
Three,

23:11.306 --> 23:12.265
two,

23:13.600 --> 23:15.018
- one.
- [distressed breathing]

23:15.685 --> 23:19.356
- [Mr. Jung] Wait!
- What? Why, why, why?

23:21.191 --> 23:22.109
I'll talk, yeah.

23:25.404 --> 23:27.155
- [Woo-jin grunts]
- [Gun-woo breathing heavily]

23:27.239 --> 23:28.323
[Mr. Moon] Tuck down, asshole.

23:29.616 --> 23:30.659
Get inside, hurry!

23:31.993 --> 23:34.162
- I said fuckin' tuck down.
- [groans]

23:38.458 --> 23:41.211
Uh, sir, we'll go
and save Mr. Oh right away.

23:41.294 --> 23:43.130
Can you hold on to Kang In-beom
in the meantime?

23:43.213 --> 23:45.215
What are you talking about?
I'm coming with you guys.

23:45.298 --> 23:46.716
We're gonna do it ourselves.

23:47.759 --> 23:49.594
Your arm's in bad shape, sir.

23:50.178 --> 23:52.055
[groans] Fuck me.

23:52.139 --> 23:55.642
Uh, sir, Kang In-beom knows
where Kim Myeong-gil's slush funds are,

23:56.351 --> 23:58.478
plus the location
of the safe containing those funds

23:58.562 --> 23:59.604
and Mr. Choi's gold.

24:00.313 --> 24:03.442
Please get all that information out of him
using your Marine tactics.

24:03.525 --> 24:04.609
We need you, sir. Please.

24:05.485 --> 24:06.361
All right.

24:06.903 --> 24:07.737
You got it.

24:09.448 --> 24:10.866
You just get him back, okay?

24:11.450 --> 24:12.367
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

24:12.993 --> 24:14.202
Let's go. Da-min.

24:15.996 --> 24:17.247
[tires screeching]

24:22.961 --> 24:24.880
NATIONAL POLICE AGENCY

24:29.926 --> 24:30.802
[Gang-yong] Here.

24:32.220 --> 24:34.139
[sighs] What do you think?

24:34.806 --> 24:38.727
[Han-gu] Sir, I've seen him this prick
standing next to the chief of staff.

24:39.936 --> 24:40.979
The chief of staff?

24:41.062 --> 24:43.857
Yes, sir. The hooked nose and those ears.
I'm positive.

24:45.192 --> 24:47.486
Why would a scummy loan shark bribe
the presidential office?

24:47.569 --> 24:48.778
I bet he sticks his nose everywhere.

24:49.362 --> 24:51.907
Or he could be a bigger player
than we actually realize.

24:53.158 --> 24:54.910
- [cell phone vibrating]
- [Gang-yong sighs]

24:54.993 --> 24:56.953
HEAVY DRINKER GUN-WOO

24:58.288 --> 24:59.122
What's up?

24:59.206 --> 25:01.333
Hey, man, sorry for calling you
at such a late hour,

25:01.416 --> 25:03.960
but we didn't know what to do
in this situation, so we had to reach out.

25:04.544 --> 25:07.214
- What?
- Kim Myeong-gil, he kidnapped Mr. Oh.

25:07.297 --> 25:09.257
So I'm heading to Seoryeong
with Woo-jin right now.

25:09.341 --> 25:10.509
Just the two of you?

25:10.592 --> 25:12.385
Why the hell
are you only telling me this now?

25:12.469 --> 25:13.303
I'm sorry,

25:13.386 --> 25:16.556
but they told us that they'd kill Mr. Oh
if we said anything to the cops.

25:16.640 --> 25:17.641
[Gang-yong] Hold on.

25:18.558 --> 25:20.352
Did Kim Myeong-gil call you himself?

25:20.435 --> 25:22.229
No, no. We managed to capture
one of his thugs.

25:22.312 --> 25:23.480
He's the one who told us.

25:23.563 --> 25:26.066
[Gang-yong] So, you don't know for sure
if Kim Myeong-gil will be there?

25:26.149 --> 25:26.983
No.

25:28.902 --> 25:30.737
Send me the location. I'll head over now.

25:30.820 --> 25:32.322
Don't go in. Just wait for me, okay?

25:32.405 --> 25:33.281
Okay.

25:34.658 --> 25:36.451
- Dude, text him the info.
- Okay.

25:39.454 --> 25:40.872
[cell phone vibrating]

25:40.956 --> 25:41.790
Sir.

25:41.873 --> 25:44.417
[Gang-yong] Jae-min,
come down to the meeting room right now.

25:45.168 --> 25:46.002
All right, sir.

25:54.052 --> 25:57.597
Hey, listen here. Call in some backup.
It's Buseong-myeon in Seoryeong.

25:57.681 --> 25:59.724
It's about that thing
I mentioned last time.

25:59.808 --> 26:01.560
- Yes, sir.
- Thank you.

26:01.643 --> 26:03.270
[Tae-yeong] When did you see them?

26:04.396 --> 26:05.438
About a month ago.

26:06.439 --> 26:07.857
LIEUTENANT KIM JAE-MIN

26:10.360 --> 26:11.194
Mm.

26:22.747 --> 26:24.749
MR. KIM MYEONG-GIL

26:26.751 --> 26:28.712
[Myeong-gil] The cops are on their way.

26:28.795 --> 26:29.838
Okay, got it.

26:30.505 --> 26:32.299
[muffled grunting]

26:38.096 --> 26:40.724
Yo, the cops are comin'. Clean up!

26:47.439 --> 26:48.857
[dramatic music playing]

26:54.362 --> 26:55.363
[shallow breathing]

27:03.288 --> 27:05.290
[cop 1] All right.
Check if there's a back entrance.

27:05.373 --> 27:07.584
- Come on, quick. Quick, move out.
- [cop 2] Hurry up.

27:08.209 --> 27:09.502
[engine revving]

27:17.552 --> 27:18.386
[music ends]

27:19.346 --> 27:20.472
Turn off the engine.

27:20.555 --> 27:21.389
Sorry.

27:21.931 --> 27:24.392
Hey, we'll see what's going on inside.
Wait here.

27:26.895 --> 27:30.065
We just searched the place.
There's nothing here but a flatfish farm.

27:30.649 --> 27:31.608
Oh…

27:33.485 --> 27:34.861
Maybe this guy will know something.

27:39.074 --> 27:40.367
Who the hell is this asshole?

27:40.867 --> 27:41.993
Kim Myeong-gil's thug.

27:42.702 --> 27:44.037
The one who stabbed me.

27:45.038 --> 27:45.914
[Gang-yong sighs]

27:47.916 --> 27:50.335
I'm a cop, and I've got some questions
you need to answer.

27:52.587 --> 27:53.713
You prick, nod your head.

27:55.256 --> 27:56.675
Is Seoul Fish Farm the right place?

27:57.258 --> 27:58.259
[grunts]

27:59.219 --> 28:00.679
Did anyone know that we were coming?

28:00.762 --> 28:01.680
[grunts]

28:03.473 --> 28:04.391
[Gang-yong sighs]

28:04.974 --> 28:05.975
Gang-yong.

28:06.601 --> 28:09.020
This guy's crew gave us the slip
in the middle of the fight.

28:09.688 --> 28:11.564
They might've given them a heads-up
before we got here.

28:16.403 --> 28:18.780
Let this guy out and leave now.

28:18.863 --> 28:20.323
You guys weren't here. Is that clear?

28:20.407 --> 28:21.449
- Okay.
- Okay.

28:21.533 --> 28:22.992
- [Gang-yong] Are you hurt?
- [both] No.

28:23.993 --> 28:24.828
Han-gu.

28:29.749 --> 28:31.126
[suspenseful music playing]

28:35.171 --> 28:36.673
Where is Grandpa?

28:38.091 --> 28:39.259
We need to wait a little more.

28:39.342 --> 28:40.844
The detectives should get back to us.

28:41.428 --> 28:43.430
[exhales sharply] We don't have much time.

28:43.513 --> 28:44.973
[Da-min whimpering]

28:47.350 --> 28:48.393
We have to find him.

28:50.061 --> 28:51.396
No matter what it takes.

28:52.731 --> 28:54.441
[Mr. Moon] The safe! Where's the safe?

28:55.066 --> 28:57.694
Come on, you fuckhead.
Where's Kim Myeong-gil's safe?

28:57.777 --> 28:59.154
- Damn it! Come on!
- [groaning]

28:59.237 --> 29:03.032
Listen, asshole, if you keep this up,
you're gonna end up dead, you hear me?

29:03.658 --> 29:05.076
[breathing rapidly]

29:06.870 --> 29:08.580
[cackles]

29:17.172 --> 29:18.590
Okay, give me a cigarette.

29:20.467 --> 29:21.551
You piece of shit!

29:21.634 --> 29:23.303
- [Mr. Moon grunting]
- [In-beom laughing]

29:23.386 --> 29:24.763
[laughing]

29:26.306 --> 29:28.183
- [In-beom laughing] Hit me!
- Fuck him!

29:28.266 --> 29:30.435
Hit me harder!

29:34.522 --> 29:37.066
BEST PORK
BEOMSEUNG DISTRIBUTION

29:46.826 --> 29:47.744
[Mr. Moon] How'd it go?

29:48.369 --> 29:49.704
Why isn't Mr. Oh with you?

29:49.788 --> 29:50.955
Uh, we couldn't find him.

29:51.039 --> 29:53.208
I think his thugs caught on to us
and took him somewhere else.

29:53.291 --> 29:54.667
Damn it.

29:54.751 --> 29:55.794
That gym rat say anything?

29:55.877 --> 29:57.754
That's one stubborn fucker in there.

29:57.837 --> 29:59.088
He won't say a word.

30:00.131 --> 30:01.633
- [Woo-jin sighs]
- [In-beom shouting]

30:01.716 --> 30:03.593
[laughing maniacally]

30:04.344 --> 30:06.054
- [growls]
- Having fun, huh?

30:08.056 --> 30:11.267
- You want fun? I'll show you fun.
- What the hell are you gonna do now?

30:13.561 --> 30:14.687
[grunts]

30:18.358 --> 30:19.943
[groaning]

30:21.194 --> 30:22.278
[coughing]

30:23.571 --> 30:24.572
Shit!

30:25.156 --> 30:27.575
Sir! That idiot, he bit his tongue.

30:28.368 --> 30:29.828
- [Mr. Moon] Fuck!
- [man] Come on, sir!

30:31.496 --> 30:33.331
Goddammit! Fuck!

30:33.414 --> 30:35.542
- Hey! Hey!
- Fuck.

30:35.625 --> 30:37.752
- Hey, Kang In-beom, snap out of it! Hey!
- Damn it!

30:37.836 --> 30:40.755
- [grunts] Dude, call an ambulance now.
- Okay.

30:41.256 --> 30:42.340
Uh, wait! Wait, wait!

30:42.924 --> 30:45.593
If we just send him off,
how will we find Kim Myeong-gil's safe?

30:45.677 --> 30:48.221
Still, we can't just stand here
and let a person die, sir.

30:49.013 --> 30:51.474
If he dies like this,
we still won't be able to get to the safe.

30:52.559 --> 30:53.893
Okay, give it to me quick.

30:54.435 --> 30:56.020
- You gotta let me get him down.
- Fuck!

30:56.104 --> 30:56.980
Okay. Come on.

31:03.862 --> 31:05.405
[paramedic] Sir! Sir, are you all right?

31:06.239 --> 31:08.324
- Sir, wake up! Are you okay?
- [grunting]

31:14.706 --> 31:15.874
[Gang-yong] Hello.

31:15.957 --> 31:18.710
- [employee] Hello.
- [chuckles softly] Where's the owner?

31:19.210 --> 31:20.670
Oh, yes, she went on vacation.

31:21.254 --> 31:22.088
Oh.

31:22.755 --> 31:24.966
I'd like an iced hand-drip coffee
with Ethiopian beans.

31:25.049 --> 31:25.884
[employee] All right.

31:27.385 --> 31:29.929
- Here you go. It'll be right out.
- All right. Thank you.

31:31.598 --> 31:32.891
MY HAPPY FAMILY, I'LL KEEP YOU SAFE

31:35.894 --> 31:37.395
[tense music playing]

31:43.067 --> 31:45.069
- [heavy breathing]
- [cell phone vibrating]

31:48.823 --> 31:51.451
CEO KIM MYEONG-GIL
ATTACHED FILE: 1 VIDEO FILE

31:57.081 --> 31:58.249
Oh shit!

32:04.339 --> 32:05.340
Hey, Min-beom.

32:06.215 --> 32:08.551
Kim Myeong-gil still has the video of me.

32:09.636 --> 32:10.762
He just sent it to me.

32:11.262 --> 32:12.096
Uh, but how?

32:15.892 --> 32:16.976
[Mr. Hong] Hello?

32:17.060 --> 32:18.227
- Gang-yong?
- [grunts]

32:19.020 --> 32:20.229
- Hello?
- [panting]

32:26.277 --> 32:27.111
Damn it!

32:31.532 --> 32:32.367
[grunts]

32:32.450 --> 32:33.284
[man whimpers]

32:33.826 --> 32:34.702
Fuck.

32:39.624 --> 32:40.625
[Gang-yong panting]

32:50.301 --> 32:51.594
[tense music playing]

32:58.768 --> 32:59.602
[man grunts]

33:01.771 --> 33:03.314
[Han-gu screams]

33:04.107 --> 33:05.358
[grunting]

33:05.984 --> 33:07.110
[panting]

33:08.152 --> 33:09.362
[grunting]

33:14.242 --> 33:15.451
[attacker] Motherfucker.

33:16.536 --> 33:17.745
- [attacker grunts]
- [screams]

33:20.665 --> 33:21.499
Salt.

33:21.582 --> 33:22.583
What?

33:22.667 --> 33:24.085
Salt!

33:24.168 --> 33:25.712
[gasps, whimpers]

33:25.795 --> 33:26.838
[Han-gu screams]

33:27.588 --> 33:28.464
[Han-gu groans]

33:32.552 --> 33:33.386
[retches]

33:39.767 --> 33:40.852
[coughing]

33:41.519 --> 33:42.353
[grunts]

33:43.354 --> 33:44.814
[crosswalk signal beeping]

33:47.191 --> 33:48.735
[tires screeching]

33:48.818 --> 33:50.611
[man] Someone's been hit by a car!

33:51.320 --> 33:52.196
What happened?

33:52.280 --> 33:54.699
[woman] Oh my God! I think someone died.

33:57.493 --> 33:59.245
MR. OH

34:02.165 --> 34:04.375
Gun-woo, hurry. Look.

34:07.128 --> 34:08.796
[cell phone vibrating]

34:12.967 --> 34:14.469
[Myeong-gil] Hey, shitheads.

34:15.053 --> 34:16.971
Why make a big problem out of nothing?

34:17.055 --> 34:18.014
[sighs]

34:18.806 --> 34:19.807
What do you want from us?

34:20.475 --> 34:21.309
[scoffs]

34:22.226 --> 34:24.520
Come to the fish farm today at 9:00 p.m.

34:25.104 --> 34:26.981
If you decide to call the cops again,

34:27.482 --> 34:29.984
I'll grind up the old man
and feed him to the fish.

34:30.693 --> 34:31.903
You got it?

34:33.029 --> 34:35.990
I've gotten rid of Min Gang-yong
and all his cronies,

34:36.074 --> 34:37.575
so there's no one else to help you.

34:38.076 --> 34:39.452
Oh, and one more thing,

34:40.036 --> 34:41.662
if you mess around, your mom's next.

34:41.746 --> 34:43.748
- [inhales deeply]
- See you there.

34:44.624 --> 34:45.458
[phone beeps]

34:45.541 --> 34:46.626
[tense music playing]

34:47.376 --> 34:48.878
GANG-YONG

34:50.213 --> 34:51.506
[line ringing]

34:52.006 --> 34:53.132
[exhales sharply]

34:53.216 --> 34:54.133
[sighs]

34:55.009 --> 34:56.928
How'd he get to Gang-yong? He's a cop.

34:57.762 --> 34:59.597
Dude, I think things
might get really dangerous.

34:59.680 --> 35:01.140
We should really go alone this time.

35:01.808 --> 35:02.767
[Da-min] Excuse me?

35:05.478 --> 35:06.604
How long have you been there?

35:06.687 --> 35:08.106
The whole time.

35:09.732 --> 35:12.568
Don't even try to leave me out.
I'm going to rescue Grandpa.

35:13.736 --> 35:14.570
[Gun-woo sighs]

35:18.699 --> 35:19.534
Come with me.

35:26.332 --> 35:29.627
[Gun-woo sighs, breathes deeply]

35:29.710 --> 35:30.837
Listen, Woo-jin,

35:30.920 --> 35:34.048
if something bad were to happen
to Mr. Oh right in front of us,

35:34.882 --> 35:37.885
Da-min's definitely going to
break down like Hyeon-ju did and I…

35:39.220 --> 35:41.848
I never want to see
something like that happen again.

35:42.598 --> 35:43.474
But Gun-woo,

35:44.851 --> 35:46.602
one thing that's different from back then.

35:47.228 --> 35:48.354
You know what that is?

35:49.355 --> 35:50.231
Back then,

35:51.190 --> 35:53.693
the invincible Marine duo were apart.

35:54.610 --> 35:56.028
That's not the case now.

35:56.112 --> 35:59.031
And we're stronger. A lot strong.
You remember, right?

35:59.991 --> 36:01.868
One, two, three, four, five.

36:01.951 --> 36:03.661
One, two, three, four, five!

36:03.744 --> 36:05.955
[inhales deeply, exhales]

36:06.038 --> 36:07.707
[gentle piano music playing]

36:07.790 --> 36:08.666
Look,

36:10.334 --> 36:12.587
let's work together,
so we can save everyone.

36:13.629 --> 36:15.131
Mr. Oh, Da-min,

36:15.840 --> 36:18.426
the people that Kim Myeong-gil hurt.

36:22.513 --> 36:23.347
[music ends]

36:23.431 --> 36:24.348
Ack?

36:24.432 --> 36:25.516
Ack!

36:27.226 --> 36:28.060
Ack!

36:29.145 --> 36:30.313
Ack!

36:30.396 --> 36:32.231
[uptempo electronic music playing]

36:41.073 --> 36:42.158
Why'd we stop?

36:42.867 --> 36:44.410
Woo-jin and I are gonna head in first.

36:44.493 --> 36:46.495
Keep a look
until you find a good spot to shoot from.

36:46.579 --> 36:47.538
That's when you move in.

36:47.622 --> 36:48.581
Sounds good.

36:49.457 --> 36:50.458
You should get out.

37:09.143 --> 37:10.228
[breathing heavily]

37:14.023 --> 37:16.359
They could've dropped me off closer.

37:20.238 --> 37:21.822
- Good thinking.
- Hm?

37:23.032 --> 37:26.035
Dropping Da-min off far away
so that she doesn't get hurt.

37:26.744 --> 37:29.914
Uh, I just didn't want her
to end up getting caught.

37:31.707 --> 37:32.708
Was it too far?

37:34.794 --> 37:36.337
It'll take her ten minutes.

37:36.420 --> 37:38.214
Then let's get this over with fast.

37:38.798 --> 37:39.632
Okay.

37:41.550 --> 37:43.052
[engine revs]

37:52.186 --> 37:53.354
[ominous music playing]

37:55.147 --> 37:56.190
[Gun-woo exhales sharply]

38:12.123 --> 38:14.083
[suspenseful music playing]

38:29.098 --> 38:30.182
[Woo-jin exhales deeply]

38:32.435 --> 38:34.145
[chuckles]

38:35.730 --> 38:37.565
[grunting]

38:38.899 --> 38:39.859
[Gun-woo sighs]

38:41.110 --> 38:42.278
[speaker feedback]

38:45.489 --> 38:46.490
[speaker static]

38:47.116 --> 38:48.868
Kill them!

38:48.951 --> 38:50.953
[percussion music playing]

38:52.621 --> 38:53.622
[goon 1] Get 'em.

38:53.706 --> 38:55.207
These guys have a shit ton of weapons.

38:55.708 --> 38:57.126
[Woo-jin grunting]

39:00.171 --> 39:01.047
[metal clanging]

39:01.130 --> 39:02.757
[grunting]

39:02.840 --> 39:03.674
Dude!

39:06.135 --> 39:07.303
[goon 2 groans]

39:08.012 --> 39:09.347
[rock music playing]

39:10.890 --> 39:12.767
[Gun-woo grunting]

39:15.353 --> 39:16.645
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- [goon 3 groans]

39:19.940 --> 39:21.359
[goon 4 screams]

39:33.079 --> 39:34.830
[goons scream]

39:41.504 --> 39:42.505
[Woo-jin grunts]

39:45.466 --> 39:46.300
Son of a bitch!

39:48.844 --> 39:50.304
[Woo-jin grunts]

40:08.572 --> 40:09.657
[grunts]

40:10.199 --> 40:11.158
[grunts]

40:12.326 --> 40:13.577
[both grunting]

40:20.418 --> 40:22.378
- I'm gonna fuck you up, man!
- [grunts]

40:22.461 --> 40:23.379
Oh shit.

40:23.921 --> 40:25.089
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- [groans]

40:26.340 --> 40:27.258
[goon 5 groans]

40:28.175 --> 40:29.093
[Myeong-gil] Hey.

40:30.136 --> 40:32.179
You can't even get rid of two kids?

40:32.263 --> 40:33.514
[goons grunting]

40:34.390 --> 40:35.307
I'm sorry, sir.

40:35.391 --> 40:37.226
Sorry isn't fucking good enough.

40:41.313 --> 40:42.565
Now then.

40:43.065 --> 40:43.899
[Mr. Oh groans]

40:43.983 --> 40:45.651
Come on!

40:47.069 --> 40:47.903
Now,

40:48.612 --> 40:52.324
you punks come any closer,
and I'll slit the old timer's throat.

40:52.408 --> 40:53.367
You understand me?

40:54.076 --> 40:56.287
[chuckles] Too bad. I wanted to do it.

40:56.370 --> 40:57.872
- [Myeong-gil grunts]
- [Mr. Oh groans]

40:58.456 --> 40:59.331
[exhales sharply]

40:59.999 --> 41:00.875
[sighs]

41:01.542 --> 41:02.376
[Woo-jin sighs]

41:04.420 --> 41:07.756
Hurry up and kill them, you stupid fucks!
What are you waiting for?

41:08.549 --> 41:10.259
Do I have to kill them? Huh?

41:10.342 --> 41:12.678
You sons of bitches are just unbelievable.

41:13.179 --> 41:14.889
[uptempo electronic music playing]

41:18.100 --> 41:19.101
Hey, duck!

41:20.769 --> 41:23.939
- [goons yell]
- [Myeong-gil groaning]

41:24.648 --> 41:25.816
[rock music playing]

41:27.735 --> 41:29.653
You fuckin' son of a bitch!

41:29.737 --> 41:32.114
Come here, you fucker! Come here!

41:32.198 --> 41:34.116
I told you to hurry up
and kill them, you assholes!

41:34.200 --> 41:35.993
What are you doing? Let go, motherfucker!

41:36.660 --> 41:37.828
- [Woo-jin grunts]
- [groans]

41:41.248 --> 41:42.374
[screams]

41:43.751 --> 41:45.544
I said let go of me!

41:48.130 --> 41:49.882
Kill them! Come on!

41:49.965 --> 41:51.258
[Gun-woo grunts]

41:58.682 --> 42:00.100
[engine revving]

42:05.272 --> 42:06.774
[panting]

42:11.612 --> 42:12.446
[music ends]

42:12.530 --> 42:14.240
- [Woo-jin grunts]
- [Mr. Oh breathing heavily]

42:14.323 --> 42:15.241
Grandpa!

42:15.324 --> 42:17.034
- Grandpa, are you okay?
- [Mr. Oh groaning]

42:17.117 --> 42:19.578
- [Woo-jin and Mr. Oh grunting]
- It's me, Da-min.

42:20.162 --> 42:21.413
[groans, whimpers]

42:21.914 --> 42:22.831
[yelps]

42:24.041 --> 42:24.917
- Oh.
- [Mr. Oh groans]

42:26.710 --> 42:29.171
You pulled out my eyebrows.

42:30.798 --> 42:31.966
[Mr. Oh groaning]

42:32.049 --> 42:33.259
Mr. Oh, are you all right?

42:35.719 --> 42:36.887
Thank you.

42:38.430 --> 42:39.557
[all sigh]

42:41.016 --> 42:42.434
[sirens wailing]

42:46.605 --> 42:48.315
- [goons moaning]
- [cop 1] Hurry up.

42:49.441 --> 42:52.069
- [cop 2] What's this?
- [cop 3] All right. All right, come on.

42:52.152 --> 42:54.071
[cop 4] Come on, get on it.
Hurry up and untie them.

42:57.658 --> 42:59.660
[uptempo instrumental music playing]

43:01.453 --> 43:02.371
Who is it?

43:03.038 --> 43:04.164
[cop 5] Delivery.

43:13.340 --> 43:15.050
[man] Ah, what the fuck.

43:15.884 --> 43:17.886
Stay still, you fucking asshole!

43:17.970 --> 43:19.054
[man groaning]

43:20.764 --> 43:22.600
[cop 6] Do a full sweep,
including the interior!

43:23.100 --> 43:24.893
- Scour every inch!
- [cop 7] What is this place?

43:28.022 --> 43:29.690
[cop 8] I found it! Everyone over here!

43:29.773 --> 43:30.941
Oh, God.

43:31.483 --> 43:34.653
What the hell? These guys are psychopaths.
What were they doing here?

43:38.824 --> 43:41.243
Ma'am, we from
the Serious Crime Investigation Division.

43:41.327 --> 43:43.245
I have a search warrant.

43:43.746 --> 43:46.415
As of right now, your property
will be subjected to search and seizure

43:46.498 --> 43:47.833
We'd appreciate your cooperation.

43:47.916 --> 43:48.751
Let's go.

43:49.418 --> 43:50.544
Come on. Hurry up.

43:54.131 --> 43:55.257
[Jae-min exhales]

43:55.841 --> 43:56.925
[detective] Mr. Kim Jae-min?

43:57.760 --> 44:00.054
You're under arrest
for murder, bribery, kidnapping.

44:01.263 --> 44:03.932
Fuck me. This is so fucked up, man.

44:04.600 --> 44:05.434
[detective] Let's go.

44:07.227 --> 44:09.438
- [cop 9] Sir, check it out.
- Wow.

44:18.614 --> 44:19.448
NATIONAL POLICE HOSPITAL

44:19.531 --> 44:22.076
Luckily we got the warrant quickly
and went into Kim Myeong-gil's house.

44:22.159 --> 44:24.328
A bunch of cell phones were found
in his closet.

44:24.995 --> 44:26.705
- [sighs]
- We traced the numbers.

44:26.789 --> 44:28.832
And they all belonged
to dead or missing individuals.

44:28.916 --> 44:31.126
[scoffs] This crazy asshole.

44:31.960 --> 44:34.421
He was storing the phones
that belonged to the people he killed.

44:35.172 --> 44:36.548
He can't escape this.

44:36.632 --> 44:38.676
Not even the American president
can help him.

44:38.759 --> 44:40.094
Could go overseas.

44:40.594 --> 44:42.930
He's a wanted man now. It won't be easy.

44:43.013 --> 44:46.141
Criminals frequently go to China
on cargo ships, don't they?

44:46.225 --> 44:48.394
Kim Myeong-gil is
a grade-A wanted criminal.

44:48.477 --> 44:50.688
We'll be focusing surveillance
on potential stowaway routes.

44:50.771 --> 44:52.564
He won't get out of Korea that easily.

44:52.648 --> 44:54.566
But it's not completely off the table.

44:56.110 --> 44:59.530
You all seem to think this is all over,
but I'm really on edge right now.

44:59.613 --> 45:01.573
That bastard still has that video of me.

45:01.657 --> 45:03.909
If he releases it at any time,
it's all over for me.

45:07.830 --> 45:08.664
[sighs]

45:09.331 --> 45:10.249
Brother.

45:10.999 --> 45:13.585
I really have to see
that maniac behind bars.

45:14.211 --> 45:15.587
[inhales sharply] Min-beom.

45:18.549 --> 45:19.717
I understand.

45:21.427 --> 45:22.594
[smacks lips, inhales]

45:23.178 --> 45:25.013
But just look at Han-gu's condition.

45:26.140 --> 45:27.808
And Tae-yeong is still in a coma.

45:28.934 --> 45:30.102
We just need some time.

45:35.649 --> 45:36.483
[Mr. Hong sighs]

45:38.360 --> 45:39.403
We're gonna help find him.

45:40.738 --> 45:42.656
It's not over till it's over for real.

45:43.824 --> 45:47.286
Um, is there any way you could find out
where Im Jang-do might be?

45:47.870 --> 45:48.912
Why do you need Im Jang-do?

45:48.996 --> 45:52.958
Im Jang-do's probably in hiding somewhere
trying to stay away from Kim Myeong-gil.

45:53.041 --> 45:57.463
I think maybe Im Jang-do may know
where Kim Myeong-gil might run off to.

45:57.546 --> 45:59.757
That's right.
Im Jang-do may have given him tips

45:59.840 --> 46:01.550
on how to smuggle himself
out of the country.

46:01.633 --> 46:03.886
He mentioned earlier
he was in charge of stuff like that.

46:04.803 --> 46:06.638
[exhales] All right, I'll look into it.

46:11.643 --> 46:13.437
[rock music playing]

46:14.062 --> 46:17.441
- [Jun-min] All right, how much in cash?
- I think I can give you 18 million.

46:18.776 --> 46:21.987
[Gang-yong] Im Jang-do hasn't used
a phone or credit card under his name

46:22.070 --> 46:23.280
in the last six months.

46:24.364 --> 46:27.075
He's avoided anything
that might give us a lead.

46:27.159 --> 46:28.786
So we don't have anything?

46:29.369 --> 46:34.082
Well, so far all we've found
is his bank account number.

46:34.166 --> 46:37.920
And apparently, he did a cash withdrawal
last March in Suwon.

46:38.003 --> 46:39.505
Can't you follow that?

46:39.588 --> 46:43.050
We could, but we'll have to check
a few months' worth of security footage,

46:43.133 --> 46:45.302
which would take some time.

46:46.386 --> 46:48.764
[Gun-woo] Do you think
we could get his account number?

46:48.847 --> 46:49.765
IM JANG-DO
JOHAN BANK

46:49.848 --> 46:52.142
This prick is super strapped for cash,

46:52.226 --> 46:54.937
so wire some money into that account,
and when you send it,

46:55.020 --> 46:57.397
put down your phone number
under the sender's name.

46:57.481 --> 46:59.233
Then he'll contact you
straight away for sure.

46:59.316 --> 47:01.819
- How much should we send him?
- A big one should do.

47:02.402 --> 47:03.278
Ten thousand won?

47:04.363 --> 47:06.949
I was wondering
if I should mention this last time,

47:07.032 --> 47:09.910
but in this line of work,
"a big one" differs by the situation.

47:10.410 --> 47:12.538
That big one
from when I got you Kang In-beom's info,

47:12.621 --> 47:14.748
that was supposed to be a million won.

47:14.832 --> 47:15.958
A million won?

47:16.041 --> 47:19.127
It's cool. It's cool.
I'm not asking for that money now, okay?

47:19.211 --> 47:20.629
I'm not some greedy asshole.

47:20.712 --> 47:21.964
We're family, after all.

47:22.047 --> 47:24.591
Okay, in this case,
how much are we talking about?

47:24.675 --> 47:26.468
He'll laugh at a million won.

47:27.010 --> 47:27.845
Ten million.

47:27.928 --> 47:29.346
[both inhale sharply]

47:29.429 --> 47:30.806
He'll bite right away.

47:32.015 --> 47:33.058
[both sigh]

47:38.397 --> 47:39.690
[Myeong-gil groans]

47:40.232 --> 47:43.735
[splutters] Your wounds aren't healing
because you keep drinking alcohol--

47:45.070 --> 47:46.238
[doctor whimpers]

47:53.495 --> 47:55.038
[breathes deeply]

47:55.873 --> 47:57.583
- Doctor.
- Yes, sir.

47:58.166 --> 48:00.419
- Do your job.
- Yes, sir.

48:04.631 --> 48:05.507
[chuckles softly]

48:06.008 --> 48:07.009
Shit.

48:07.092 --> 48:08.260
[both] Sixty-six,

48:08.886 --> 48:10.095
sixty-seven,

48:10.178 --> 48:12.180
- sixty-eight, sixty-nine.
- [cell phone vibrating]

48:12.264 --> 48:13.724
Dude, someone's calling.

48:14.808 --> 48:15.976
There's no number.

48:22.232 --> 48:23.275
Hello?

48:28.113 --> 48:28.947
Hello?

48:29.031 --> 48:30.073
[exhales]

48:32.367 --> 48:33.201
Hello?

48:35.037 --> 48:35.871
You.

48:36.705 --> 48:38.540
The kid that was with Mr. Choi, right?

48:42.169 --> 48:43.003
Yes.

48:43.921 --> 48:45.923
And the cops told you my account number.

48:47.799 --> 48:48.634
Why?

48:49.468 --> 48:50.719
Why did you send the money?

48:51.720 --> 48:53.388
Because Kim Myeong-gil is running away.

48:54.181 --> 48:55.057
Why?

48:55.641 --> 48:57.225
Police have raided his house

48:57.309 --> 48:59.853
and found substantial evidence
that he killed several people.

48:59.937 --> 49:02.230
- When was that?
- Two days ago.

49:03.231 --> 49:05.984
You know where
Kim Myeong-gil will run to, don't you?

49:08.820 --> 49:09.655
I do.

49:10.322 --> 49:11.490
[Gun-woo] Listen.

49:11.573 --> 49:14.701
We have to catch him.
Please help us find out where he is.

49:18.038 --> 49:19.247
How much will you pay?

49:22.084 --> 49:23.335
Uh, a big one.

49:23.418 --> 49:26.421
[scoffs]
You've got to be fucking kidding me.

49:28.298 --> 49:30.175
- I want a billion.
- A billion?

49:30.258 --> 49:32.803
I trusted President Choi
and got royally fucked over.

49:32.886 --> 49:34.513
I deserve at least a billion.

49:34.596 --> 49:36.181
Okay, but we don't have--

49:36.264 --> 49:38.266
Within a few days,
Kim Myeong-gil will flee overseas

49:38.350 --> 49:40.102
using the method I taught him.

49:41.770 --> 49:43.146
You know my account, right?

49:44.189 --> 49:45.107
Think it over.

49:48.235 --> 49:50.112
[sighs] That it so fucked.

49:50.988 --> 49:52.364
How will we ever get a billion won?

49:53.615 --> 49:55.534
Should we ask Mr. Oh
if he could do anything?

49:55.617 --> 49:57.160
Mr. Oh doesn't have money.

49:57.744 --> 50:00.330
The money he gave us back then
was all he had left.

50:00.872 --> 50:01.707
Hold up.

50:07.713 --> 50:08.755
How much do we have in there?

50:11.883 --> 50:13.385
I think around 300 million.

50:13.468 --> 50:14.761
It's nowhere enough.

50:15.595 --> 50:16.513
[sighs]

50:17.973 --> 50:19.975
Should we ask Min-beom
if we could borrow some money?

50:20.058 --> 50:22.394
Im Jang-do's the one
who took that video of Min-beom.

50:23.478 --> 50:25.772
You think he'll help us with this?

50:26.732 --> 50:27.566
I don't know.

50:28.316 --> 50:31.153
But I think Min-beom's the only one
who could help us in this situation.

50:32.154 --> 50:33.947
Let's try asking him just once, mm?

50:42.497 --> 50:43.874
[man] Sir, here they are.

50:45.667 --> 50:46.960
[distant sirens wailing]

50:47.961 --> 50:48.795
[Woo-jin sighs]

50:49.671 --> 50:51.465
Do you guys trust Im Jang-do?

50:53.633 --> 50:54.468
Uh,

50:55.635 --> 51:00.182
we do think that he can help us find…
everything that we've been looking for.

51:01.224 --> 51:03.560
What if he pockets the money
and goes overseas?

51:04.227 --> 51:05.312
Then what do we do?

51:13.528 --> 51:14.529
[inhales sharply]

51:25.415 --> 51:26.249
If he does that,

51:26.917 --> 51:30.796
if Im Jang-do breaks his promise and runs,
we'll chase him down and catch him.

51:31.421 --> 51:33.799
This much I can promise, sir.
You have my word.

51:37.427 --> 51:38.345
[Mr. Hong sighs]

51:48.939 --> 51:50.398
Keep that promise. [chuckles]

51:52.025 --> 51:53.443
- Great.
- Great.

51:54.486 --> 51:56.196
[suspenseful music playing]

51:56.279 --> 51:58.740
1,000,000,000 RECEIVED

52:11.920 --> 52:14.756
- [officer] Okay, looks good. Move along.
- Okay.

52:15.507 --> 52:16.341
You can go.

53:09.769 --> 53:11.938
UNKNOWN CALLER

53:14.524 --> 53:15.859
[Jang-do] Write this down.

53:15.942 --> 53:17.611
The day after tomorrow at 1:00 a.m.,

53:17.694 --> 53:21.198
a cargo ship called the Nike
is going to depart for Ho Chi Minh City.

53:21.281 --> 53:24.743
Kim Myeong-gil gave political donations
to a high-ranking Vietnamese official.

53:25.327 --> 53:27.454
He's going to take off
with all of his slush funds.

53:28.205 --> 53:30.957
The container number is 9004230.

53:31.458 --> 53:34.169
There will be a cargo truck
with all of his slush funds hidden inside.

53:34.252 --> 53:36.546
Should we move in
when Kim Myeong-gil's getting on the ship?

53:36.630 --> 53:38.548
It won't be easy to find
because it's a big ship.

53:38.632 --> 53:39.466
How will we find it?

53:40.050 --> 53:41.843
You guys get on the ship with him.

53:44.596 --> 53:46.514
You mean we should get on the ship
and go to Vietnam?

53:46.598 --> 53:48.141
Well, that's up to you, right?

53:48.642 --> 53:50.435
- Bye.
- [Gun-woo] Wait, wait, wait.

53:50.518 --> 53:53.146
What should we do then
if we decide to board that ship?

53:53.897 --> 53:55.523
I'll text you a contact of mine.

53:55.607 --> 53:57.442
Tell him I sent you
and try to work out a deal.

53:57.525 --> 53:59.736
Also, he really likes cash.

54:03.365 --> 54:05.742
- [Woo-jin exhales deeply]
- [cell phone vibrates]

54:06.243 --> 54:07.160
That's the text.

54:16.211 --> 54:19.130
I didn't know what you'd need,
so I brought a little bit of everything.

54:20.590 --> 54:21.424
Thank you, sir.

54:21.508 --> 54:22.759
You two take care.

54:23.635 --> 54:24.594
[Gun-woo] Yes, sir.

54:25.762 --> 54:26.721
[Mr. Oh] Okay?

54:27.931 --> 54:28.807
Yes.

54:31.268 --> 54:32.102
Let's go up.

54:33.144 --> 54:34.062
You go on ahead.

54:34.854 --> 54:35.772
I need a minute.

54:38.858 --> 54:39.859
Okay.

54:42.779 --> 54:43.613
[door closes]

54:45.657 --> 54:47.409
Thank you so much for your help.

54:48.410 --> 54:49.911
No, we should be thanking you.

54:53.456 --> 54:54.291
[both chuckle softly]

54:59.296 --> 55:01.464
Da-min, see you soon.

55:03.174 --> 55:04.759
- See you.
- [Woo-jin] Up you go.

55:08.388 --> 55:09.264
Oh.

55:10.390 --> 55:12.017
You have my number?

55:12.976 --> 55:13.810
Mm.

55:18.732 --> 55:19.816
[both chuckle softly]

55:20.734 --> 55:21.568
Let's go.

55:24.404 --> 55:25.530
[gasps]

55:26.865 --> 55:28.783
[sniffing]

55:29.492 --> 55:30.452
[car engine revs]

55:32.287 --> 55:34.497
- [Gun-woo] Hello.
- [Mr. Hong] Hey, you're on your way there?

55:35.290 --> 55:36.458
Yes, we're on our way.

55:37.334 --> 55:39.085
Don't get hurt, okay?

55:39.586 --> 55:40.420
[Gun-woo] Okay.

55:40.503 --> 55:42.756
Me and Gang-yong
will take care of the rest.

55:43.631 --> 55:44.758
Drive safe.

55:44.841 --> 55:45.675
Yeah.

55:48.553 --> 55:49.679
[engine revving]

56:20.293 --> 56:21.586
Let's hurry along then.

56:21.669 --> 56:24.381
- Just a second.
- We'll be right back.

56:37.018 --> 56:37.852
Dude.

56:41.356 --> 56:42.190
Okay.

56:55.787 --> 56:56.621
[captain] Set sail.

56:57.122 --> 56:58.832
[horn blaring]

57:07.507 --> 57:09.843
- Okay, go check out the inside first.
- Got it.

57:22.522 --> 57:23.440
[music ends]

57:25.066 --> 57:26.609
[panting]

57:33.783 --> 57:34.617
[exhales]

57:38.037 --> 57:39.831
[tense music playing]

57:52.051 --> 57:53.136
Kim Myeong-gil!

57:53.219 --> 57:54.304
[Gun-woo panting]

58:01.811 --> 58:03.771
[uptempo electronic music playing]

58:04.272 --> 58:05.315
[grunts]

58:06.274 --> 58:07.567
[panting]

58:13.198 --> 58:14.073
[inhales deeply]

58:18.536 --> 58:19.996
[panting]

58:22.665 --> 58:24.042
[suspenseful music playing]

58:24.584 --> 58:25.585
[Jun-min] Uh-huh.

58:25.668 --> 58:26.503
Uh-huh.

58:29.380 --> 58:30.924
[taser shocking]

58:31.007 --> 58:31.925
[Jun-min groans]

58:33.134 --> 58:34.010
[exhales sharply]

58:34.511 --> 58:35.345
Oh!

58:43.353 --> 58:44.521
[exhales deeply]

58:48.441 --> 58:49.567
- [Myeong-gil grunts]
- [groans]

58:49.651 --> 58:50.485
[both grunting]

58:56.699 --> 58:58.034
[both shouting]

59:02.872 --> 59:04.874
[groans, grunts]

59:04.958 --> 59:06.501
[panting]

59:08.628 --> 59:09.546
[grunts]

59:12.131 --> 59:13.550
[tense music playing]

59:16.427 --> 59:18.137
- [In-beom grunts]
- [groans]

59:20.932 --> 59:21.849
[In-beom grunts]

59:22.850 --> 59:23.893
- [In-beom grunts]
- [groans]

59:26.437 --> 59:28.106
[Woo-jin groaning]

59:36.406 --> 59:37.907
- [In-beom grunting]
- [Woo-jin yells]

59:38.700 --> 59:39.576
[Woo-jin groans]

59:40.660 --> 59:42.495
[groaning]

59:48.209 --> 59:49.294
[Myeong-gil whistles]

59:58.052 --> 59:59.387
[Myeong-gil grunts]

01:00:02.181 --> 01:00:03.516
[panting]

01:00:08.855 --> 01:00:09.981
[breathes rapidly]

01:00:12.025 --> 01:00:13.192
[groans]

01:00:20.408 --> 01:00:21.743
[dramatic music playing]

01:00:23.661 --> 01:00:24.579
[Gun-woo grunts]

01:00:24.662 --> 01:00:26.664
[Woo-jin groaning]

01:00:27.290 --> 01:00:28.124
[Woo-jin grunts]

01:00:29.917 --> 01:00:31.085
[Woo-jin grunts]

01:00:33.296 --> 01:00:34.172
[Gun-woo grunts]

01:00:34.255 --> 01:00:36.299
[uptempo electronic music playing]

01:00:44.641 --> 01:00:46.100
[both grunting]

01:00:51.648 --> 01:00:53.274
[groaning]

01:00:55.443 --> 01:00:56.694
[both grunting]

01:00:56.778 --> 01:00:58.071
[both grunting]

01:00:59.656 --> 01:01:00.698
[In-beom shouts]

01:01:05.828 --> 01:01:06.704
[coughs]

01:01:08.247 --> 01:01:09.082
[both grunting]

01:01:12.251 --> 01:01:13.086
[groans]

01:01:17.340 --> 01:01:18.257
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- [groans]

01:01:22.178 --> 01:01:23.012
[grunting]

01:01:24.931 --> 01:01:26.391
[Woo-jin panting]

01:01:26.474 --> 01:01:27.892
[In-beom grunts]

01:01:30.812 --> 01:01:33.439
[In-beom grunts, groans]

01:01:34.273 --> 01:01:35.942
- [Woo-jin grunting]
- [groaning]

01:01:39.112 --> 01:01:41.030
[Myeong-gil grunting]

01:01:42.115 --> 01:01:43.449
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- [groans]

01:01:44.575 --> 01:01:45.868
[Myeong-gil groans]

01:01:58.381 --> 01:01:59.674
[both screaming]

01:02:00.383 --> 01:02:01.968
[both groaning]

01:02:05.138 --> 01:02:06.472
- [In-beom grunts]
- [groans]

01:02:14.647 --> 01:02:15.898
[groaning]

01:02:18.609 --> 01:02:20.111
- [Woo-jin grunts]
- [groans]

01:02:20.611 --> 01:02:21.863
[exhales deeply]

01:02:23.448 --> 01:02:24.824
[both groaning]

01:02:28.202 --> 01:02:29.746
[gentle piano music playing]

01:02:32.331 --> 01:02:33.916
[Gun-woo panting]

01:02:34.000 --> 01:02:35.251
[Myeong-gil groaning]

01:02:40.298 --> 01:02:41.424
[exhales deeply]

01:02:42.216 --> 01:02:43.968
[inhales sharply, exhales deeply]

01:02:44.886 --> 01:02:46.429
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- [groans]

01:02:47.096 --> 01:02:48.014
[Gun-woo grunting]

01:02:52.018 --> 01:02:52.977
[Gun-woo grunts]

01:02:53.561 --> 01:02:54.854
[tense music playing]

01:02:56.105 --> 01:02:56.939
[exhales]

01:02:57.440 --> 01:02:59.108
If you ever show your face again…

01:03:01.944 --> 01:03:03.029
I'll kill you.

01:03:05.990 --> 01:03:07.450
[music builds, fades]

01:03:12.872 --> 01:03:13.706
[sighs]

01:03:16.250 --> 01:03:17.251
[sighs]

01:03:20.922 --> 01:03:21.798
[sighs]

01:03:40.024 --> 01:03:41.400
[inhales sharply]

01:03:42.235 --> 01:03:43.402
[exhales deeply]

01:03:48.449 --> 01:03:49.283
Gun-woo.

01:03:53.704 --> 01:03:54.622
Are you all right?

01:04:00.086 --> 01:04:01.629
[gentle piano music playing]

01:04:01.712 --> 01:04:02.588
[grunts]

01:04:06.843 --> 01:04:07.677
What is it?

01:04:10.888 --> 01:04:11.722
Dude.

01:04:15.643 --> 01:04:17.103
I've become a bloodhound.

01:04:35.037 --> 01:04:38.249
[Woo-jin] Gun-woo, have you forgotten
about the heart of a boxer?

01:04:39.876 --> 01:04:41.878
All we have to do is find our way back.

01:04:42.670 --> 01:04:43.504
Hm?

01:04:44.088 --> 01:04:45.423
Let's go back together.

01:04:51.137 --> 01:04:51.971
Mm-hm.

01:04:52.972 --> 01:04:53.890
Let's go back.

01:04:54.432 --> 01:04:55.266
[grunts]

01:05:00.771 --> 01:05:01.689
[Woo-jin grunts]

01:05:02.815 --> 01:05:03.649
[Woo-jin] Here.

01:05:04.275 --> 01:05:05.610
[triumphant music playing]

01:05:07.528 --> 01:05:08.404
[both grunt]

01:05:12.408 --> 01:05:13.951
[both grunting]

01:05:22.543 --> 01:05:23.711
[Gun-woo] Whoa! Dude!

01:05:25.963 --> 01:05:26.923
[laughing]

01:05:27.548 --> 01:05:30.343
Ah, yes! [shouts]

01:05:38.768 --> 01:05:39.602
Hey.

01:05:39.685 --> 01:05:42.229
- Hey, man, where are you?
- I'm almost there.

01:05:42.939 --> 01:05:44.482
Gold bars, did you find them?

01:05:45.066 --> 01:05:46.651
Yes, we found them all.

01:05:47.818 --> 01:05:48.653
And the phone?

01:05:50.363 --> 01:05:51.489
I'll go get it.

01:05:51.572 --> 01:05:54.492
- Oh, dude, here. Here.
- Oh, oh, oh! Let's go!

01:05:54.575 --> 01:05:55.409
[Gun-woo] Right!

01:06:03.292 --> 01:06:04.126
[music ends]

01:06:04.210 --> 01:06:05.252
[Gang-yong] How'd it go?

01:06:05.336 --> 01:06:07.213
I finally got the phone.

01:06:07.296 --> 01:06:08.214
[laughs]

01:06:08.923 --> 01:06:09.757
[exhales]

01:06:10.383 --> 01:06:11.258
They did good.

01:06:12.009 --> 01:06:14.929
I asked Interpol for backup.
They'll be waiting in Vietnam.

01:06:16.013 --> 01:06:17.181
It's all over.

01:06:17.264 --> 01:06:19.350
You really went through a lot, kiddo.

01:06:19.433 --> 01:06:20.393
Thank you.

01:06:36.325 --> 01:06:38.077
What would you guys like to do with this?

01:06:40.204 --> 01:06:41.163
[Gun-woo] Hm.

01:06:42.623 --> 01:06:46.752
Well, Mr. Choi always wanted to help
those who were too poor

01:06:46.836 --> 01:06:48.462
to get proper medical treatment,

01:06:49.755 --> 01:06:53.592
so I'd like this money to be spent
in accordance with Mr. Choi's wishes.

01:06:54.552 --> 01:06:55.886
What do you think about that idea?

01:06:57.388 --> 01:06:59.306
Don't you want the money for yourself?

01:07:03.102 --> 01:07:05.229
Uh, of course, I do.

01:07:06.063 --> 01:07:07.940
But this isn't my money.

01:07:08.941 --> 01:07:09.775
To be fair,

01:07:09.859 --> 01:07:12.194
I'm just trying to pay back Mr. Choi
for his kindness

01:07:12.278 --> 01:07:14.196
and make I sure I keep the promise
I made to him.

01:07:14.697 --> 01:07:15.531
[chuckles]

01:07:16.157 --> 01:07:17.158
Mm.

01:07:17.742 --> 01:07:19.035
[inhales deeply] Guys.

01:07:20.202 --> 01:07:23.205
We have a total of 168 golden bars,

01:07:23.289 --> 01:07:25.791
and each one would give us 500 million,

01:07:25.875 --> 01:07:27.835
putting us at 84 billion in total.

01:07:27.918 --> 01:07:30.421
- [both gasp]
- If you want, I'll take this

01:07:30.504 --> 01:07:33.799
and start a welfare foundation
all under Iil Group.

01:07:33.883 --> 01:07:35.301
Through that welfare foundation,

01:07:35.384 --> 01:07:38.304
we'll be able to provide
medical assistance to people who need it.

01:07:39.263 --> 01:07:40.097
On top of that,

01:07:40.181 --> 01:07:42.308
I should just have our company
add some money to the pot,

01:07:43.059 --> 01:07:44.685
set up a hospital while we're at it.

01:07:45.227 --> 01:07:47.313
- Well, that sounds like a great idea.
- Right?

01:07:47.396 --> 01:07:48.397
It does.

01:07:48.481 --> 01:07:50.357
[Mr. Hong]
I think my dad will like it too.

01:07:50.983 --> 01:07:53.235
And it'll help
with our company image as well.

01:07:53.319 --> 01:07:55.196
Besides, we'll do the world a lot of good.

01:07:56.238 --> 01:07:58.449
I'll get started
as soon as I'm done with the hotel.

01:07:58.532 --> 01:07:59.366
One last thing.

01:08:00.659 --> 01:08:03.329
Could you maybe include Mr. Choi
in the hospital name?

01:08:03.954 --> 01:08:06.499
- What was his name?
- His full name was Choi Tae-ho.

01:08:07.041 --> 01:08:09.835
To be honest,
I don't think it'll be that easy,

01:08:10.753 --> 01:08:12.379
but I'll definitely consider it.

01:08:12.463 --> 01:08:13.631
Thank you so much.

01:08:21.263 --> 01:08:22.473
Huh?

01:08:22.556 --> 01:08:24.934
[Mr. Hong] I'll cover the missing amount
with my own money.

01:08:25.017 --> 01:08:27.186
Think of it as a bonus
for a job well done.

01:08:27.686 --> 01:08:28.604
Um, it's all right.

01:08:28.687 --> 01:08:29.855
[hesitates] We're really good.

01:08:30.356 --> 01:08:32.441
That Mr. Choi would have done the same.

01:08:33.067 --> 01:08:33.901
Take it.

01:08:38.906 --> 01:08:41.283
[Mr. Choi] What, you don't know
what to say all of a sudden?

01:08:44.245 --> 01:08:45.579
A thank you would do.

01:08:46.997 --> 01:08:49.208
- Thank you so much, Mr. Choi.
- No.

01:08:50.960 --> 01:08:52.837
I'm the one that should be thanking you.

01:08:56.215 --> 01:08:57.299
Thank you so much!

01:08:58.342 --> 01:08:59.635
[laughs]

01:09:00.845 --> 01:09:02.388
[light rock music playing]

01:09:06.267 --> 01:09:07.101
[music ends]

01:09:07.184 --> 01:09:09.979
[boy] Let's get the ball.
Come on. Stop her!

01:09:10.521 --> 01:09:11.647
[children laughing]

01:09:12.189 --> 01:09:14.608
- [chuckles] There, right?
- [cell phone vibrating]

01:09:16.861 --> 01:09:17.695
[exhales]

01:09:18.320 --> 01:09:19.155
Oh!

01:09:20.114 --> 01:09:21.323
Gun-woo, is that you?

01:09:22.199 --> 01:09:23.367
What? Where are you?

01:09:25.703 --> 01:09:27.371
[gasps] Gun-woo!

01:09:27.872 --> 01:09:29.290
Oh! Oh!

01:09:29.915 --> 01:09:31.667
[laughing]

01:09:32.168 --> 01:09:33.335
[So-yeon exclaims]

01:09:34.795 --> 01:09:35.671
Oh!

01:09:36.881 --> 01:09:38.299
[gentle piano music playing]

01:09:40.885 --> 01:09:41.886
Oh, my son.

01:09:41.969 --> 01:09:43.470
[laughs] Ah!

01:09:44.430 --> 01:09:46.515
Oh! [laughs]

01:09:48.017 --> 01:09:48.976
Woo-jin.

01:09:49.852 --> 01:09:53.063
Oh my gosh, look at you.
What happened to your face? [inhales]

01:09:53.647 --> 01:09:55.608
God, you went through so much.

01:09:56.150 --> 01:09:58.152
[So-yeon laughing]

01:09:59.486 --> 01:10:01.488
It's all over, Mom. Let's go home now.

01:10:02.031 --> 01:10:03.032
All right. Okay.

01:10:03.115 --> 01:10:04.450
[So-yeon inhales deeply]

01:10:04.533 --> 01:10:06.702
Oh God, I'm so proud of you!

01:10:06.785 --> 01:10:08.746
Ah!

01:10:09.246 --> 01:10:10.497
[So-yeon laughing]

01:10:15.044 --> 01:10:16.545
[gentle piano music continues]

01:10:46.200 --> 01:10:47.660
[theme music playing]

01:12:05.988 --> 01:12:06.989
[theme music ends]
